     1                                  ; D5 (day2, 2026-10-04): A34 = rev1 A with the band phase 2Ch -> 34h (one immediate, 0 bytes, 0 turns).
     2                                  ; Reason: family simulator (scratch/D5/fsim.mjs) shows rev1 B's 800h trail kills rev1 A in 37.5% of long
     3                                  ; no-zombie runs at phase 2Ch, 8% at 34h, robust to +-5 turns of start timing. Good_Test V6 attribution below kept.
     4                                  ; COMBINE (night combination coordinator, 2026-10-04, base rev0): KPHL = KP + h34 (B099 KPH_B) + locpatA (B092 KL_A). A = KL_A unchanged; B = B099 KPH_B.
     5                                  ; Good_Test V6 is friend-provided code; V6nohunt and all night edits by agent2 roles (see FINDINGS.md).
     6                                  bits 16
